    <description>Reactivates a Disqualified Lead — sets Status back to Follow-up and clears the Disqualification Reason/Notes so no stale disqualification data survives. Only offered when the Lead is currently Disqualified.

LFRDN-607 #4: restarts the SLA clock on reactivation (business decision) — recomputes AF_AssignedDateTime__c and all 3 SLA targets against Now() via AF_BusinessHoursService, same calculation AF_FL_Lead_OwnerAssignment_SLA uses on create, and clears AF_FirstContactDateTime__c/AF_SLABreachLevel__c so the reactivated Lead needs a fresh first contact rather than immediately reading as already-contacted against its old timestamp.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_BusinessHoursName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASE({!Get_Lead.AF_BusinessUnit__c}, &quot;Alfardan Automobiles&quot;, &quot;AF_BH_Automobiles&quot;, &quot;Alfardan Premier Motors&quot;, &quot;AF_BH_PremierMotors&quot;, &quot;Alfardan Sports Motors&quot;, &quot;AF_BH_SportsMotors&quot;, &quot;AF_BH_Automobiles&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
